# AI context bridge

Source: `packages/web/src/app/ai-context.ts` and its tests.

- Inspect actual return values and registered commands before describing capabilities. Current chat/recent-message methods return empty context; a source comment mentioning an action does not establish an implemented action API.
- Keep read context separate from actions. Expose actions through explicit handlers, not writable store references.
- Workspace user identity is UUID-based. Legacy numeric fields in the bridge are compatibility surfaces, not a reason to convert UUIDs.
- Do not expose credentials or automatically export message content to an external service.
- Unsubscribe events and unregister commands when their owner is disposed. Validate action input and current runtime ownership before asynchronous writes.
